{"id":1096234545,"titulo":"Tokyo Underground (2002)","titulo_orig":"東京アンダーグラウンド","poster":"https://cuevana.gs/kLU6cgNT8V0cwtKj5g0NgsQNRCn.jpg","release_date":"2002-04-02","genres":[],"rating":"0.0","backdrop":"https://cuevana.gs/qz1opojKuy0HnsyRWvJC5vEJuSn.jpg","overview":"Rumina Asagi, un estudiante de secundaria que se topa con dos chicas, Ruri Sarasa y Chelsea Rorec, que han escapado de una ciudad subterránea secreta llamada Tokyo Underground. Esta ciudad es hogar de individuos con habilidades elementales. Rumina se une a Ruri y Chelsea en su lucha contra los poderosos cazadores que intentan capturar a Ruri debido a su raro poder de regeneración. Juntos, enfrentan múltiples desafíos y descubren los oscuros secretos de Tokyo Underground.","trailer":"","slug":"","servidores":[{"id":1,"url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-bimu9tcxj8e6.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Vimeos","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-bimu9tcxj8e6.html","player_url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-bimu9tcxj8e6.html"},{"id":2,"url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-zqsim3suec7z.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Goodstream","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-zqsim3suec7z.html","player_url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-zqsim3suec7z.html"},{"id":3,"url":"https://hlswish.com/e/2mgbuy65ofoz","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Hlswish","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"2mgbuy65ofoz","player_url":"https://hlswish.com/e/2mgbuy65ofoz"},{"id":4,"url":"https://voe.sx/e/stsbmdll8i6s","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Voe","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"stsbmdll8i6s","player_url":"https://voe.sx/e/stsbmdll8i6s"},{"id":5,"url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-p0cc34e8rvoy.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Vimeos","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-p0cc34e8rvoy.html","player_url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-p0cc34e8rvoy.html"},{"id":6,"url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-fp623d9qq4jp.html","idioma":"Latino","nombre":"Goodstream","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-fp623d9qq4jp.html","player_url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-fp623d9qq4jp.html"},{"id":7,"url":"htt